00:14:00.660 --> 00:14:04.860
hope to become? Well you see, we start&nbsp;
from the assumption that some of the most&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:04.860 --> 00:14:09.660
developed sectors in the country are currently&nbsp;
fintechs, biotechnology and medical tourism.
 &nbsp;

00:14:11.460 --> 00:14:13.860
To give you an idea, of the 100 local companies&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:13.860 --> 00:14:17.940
with the fastest growth between&nbsp;
2018 and 2021, 10 are fintech,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:17.940 --> 00:14:21.780
8 are in logistics and transportation,&nbsp;
and 7 are in energy and utilities.
 &nbsp;

00:14:21.780 --> 00:14:27.780
In fact, there were 1,002 fintechs registered&nbsp;
in Singapore alone as of June 2022.
 &nbsp;

00:14:29.940 --> 00:14:33.540
Although, naturally, you may not know&nbsp;
offhand whether this is a lot or a little.
 &nbsp;

00:14:38.160 --> 00:14:42.420
Well, if we compare it with the just&nbsp;
under 10,000 that exist in the United&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:42.420 --> 00:14:46.320
States – and keep in mind, it is the world&nbsp;
leader – we quickly realize that there are&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:46.320 --> 00:14:50.100
a lot of them in Singapore. The United&nbsp;
States, the world leader in this field,&nbsp;&nbsp;

